{
  "bookId": "hero-212205",
  "id": "bond-35316",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35316001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "哦！茱丽叶！为什么你是茱丽叶！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "不！罗密欧——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咳咳……那个……我是不是打扰你们排练了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316004",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "我们完了！凯普莱特家里的人来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "好罗密欧，躲起来吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那要不我先走吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "让我们谈谈，天还没有亮呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35316009",
              "text": "好吧，我只是想说——"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35316008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "可是在巡逻兵没有出发之前，你必须及早离开！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好吧，我只是想说有一张手办戏剧节的票，你们感兴趣吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "您来得正好！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35316013",
              "text": "那门票我就放这里了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35316012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35316013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "您不必急着要走，再耽搁一会儿吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
